    <h3>The Idea Behind Home2Drom</h3>
    <p>Created by <strong>Tarun </strong>, Home2Drom was born out of a simple frustration: as a hostel resident, managing daily tasks and remembering important items to bring back to the hostel could be a nightmare. You’re constantly forgetting things, juggling deadlines, and losing track of your priorities. So, we decided to make it easy for hostel students to stay on top of everything—whether it’s a big assignment or a little thing like laundry detergent.</p>

    <p>Home2Drom is designed to solve that. We wanted to create a task manager that’s tailored for hostel life—a place where you can quickly add, edit, and track tasks with priority and category options. And the best part? We also send you a weekly list of things you shouldn’t forget to bring back from home, so you’re always prepared!</p>

    <h3>How We Help You Stay Organized</h3>
    <p>With Home2Drom, organizing your day-to-day tasks is simple:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Track Tasks:</strong> Easily organize tasks with priorities and categories.</li>
      <li><strong>Stay Prepared:</strong> Get weekly reminders of what to bring back from home.</li>
      <li><strong>Stay Focused:</strong> Prioritize what matters most and never miss a deadline.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Our Mission</h3>
    <p>Our goal at Home2Drom is simple: make hostel life easier by providing a task manager that works for you. We want to help you prioritize, plan, and be productive—so you can focus on what really matters: studying, socializing, and enjoying your time in the hostel!</p>

